---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | RiddlesMaster"
  description="Read the privacy policy for RiddlesMaster to understand how we collect, store, and protect your user data."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-[#141413] max-w-none">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-[#141413] font-serif mb-6 leading-tight"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <p class="text-sm text-[#6c6a64] italic mb-8">
        Last Updated: June 9, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#3d3d3a] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          At RiddlesMaster, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This
          Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and safeguard your
          personal information when you use our platform.
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          1. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          We collect information you provide directly to us when creating an
          account, upgrading to Premium, or interacting with our services:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>
            <strong>Account Information:</strong> Your email address, name, password,
            and avatar/profile details.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Usage Data:</strong> Puzzles viewed, solution status, daily streak
            statistics, and interaction logs.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Billing Information:</strong> Payment details are processed directly
            and securely by our billing partners (e.g., Razorpay) and are not stored
            on our servers.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          2. How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use the information we collect to operate, maintain, and improve
          our services, including to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
          <li>Track and maintain your progress and daily streak counts.</li>
          <li>
            Authorize access to premium riddles and step-by-step solutions.
          </li>
          <li>
            Send security alerts, administrative messages, and support updates.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          3. Security
        </h2>
        <p>
          We use industry-standard technical measures (including Supabase
          Row-Level Security policies) to secure your account details and
          progress logs. However, no database transmission over the internet can
          be guaranteed to be 100% secure.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
